# strobe.pi: demonstrates a current-overload hazard.
# LED is toggled many times without a DELAY safety barrier.
# Default: warning. Enterprise strict mode (--hard): rejected.
LINK PIN 18 TO LED AS OUTPUT

LED HIGH
LED LOW
